\">Bitcoin News</source></item><item><title>Bitcoin sees $176.8B in inflows – But trading volume just hit 3-year low - AMBCrypto</title><link>https://news.google.?oc=5</link><guid isPermaLink=\\\"false\\\"></guid><pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 23:00:57 GMT</pubDate><description>&lt;a href=\\\"https://news.google.?oc=5\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"&gt;Bitcoin sees $176.8B in inflows – But trading volume just hit 3-year low&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=\\\"#6f6f6f\\\"&gt;AMBCrypto&lt;/font&gt;</description><source url=\\\"https://ambcrypto.com\\\">AMBCrypto</source></item><item><title>Strive CEO: Bitcoin’s 50% Crash Shows Why Digital Credit Is the Future - Yahoo Finance</title><link>https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxOWU9YZzN4c003bU1MSVFqU09nZGpDN2sxYWdtX0Z0cEVRN0hmdjhwSjMtcjkwX013Yjc5TEhBQVUyajItUTF1SjJySm1RamtuVDhVR2NnMHA4RXZQSmJOZVVxT05NTzZtUDZ2cUhLYjA3bllKYUZjY3NBYXcybmJ3SEV3R3VEWUlUNUs0dEZ4cnI0Ql9razNn?oc=5</link><guid isPermaLink=\\\"false\\\">CBMilwFBVV95cUxOWU9YZzN4c003bU1MSVFqU09nZGpDN2sxYWdtX0Z0cEVRN0hmdjhwSjMtcjkwX013Yjc5TEhBQVUyajItUTF1SjJySm1RamtuVDhVR2NnMHA4RXZQSmJOZVVxT05NTzZtUDZ2cUhLYjA3bllKYUZjY3NBYXcybmJ3SEV3R3VEWUlUNUs0dEZ4cnI0Ql9razNn</guid><pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 15:37:35 GMT</pubDate><description>&lt;a href=\\\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxOWU9YZzN4c003bU1MSVFqU09nZGpDN2sxYWdtX0Z0cEVRN0hmdjhwSjMtcjkwX013Yjc5TEhBQVUyajItUTF1SjJySm1RamtuVDhVR2NnMHA4RXZQSmJOZVVxT05NTzZtUDZ2cUhLYjA3bllKYUZjY3NBYXcybmJ3SEV3R3VEWUlUNUs0dEZ4cnI0Ql9razNn?oc=5\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"&gt;Strive CEO: Bitcoin’s 50% Crash Shows Why Digital Credit Is the Future&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=\\\"#6f6f6f\\\"&gt;Yahoo Finance&lt;/font&gt;</description><source url=\\\"https://finance.yahoo.com\\\">Yahoo Finance</source></item><item><title>Bitcoin Surging Due To Saylor? Bitwise CIO Claims Strategy Behind BTC Gains - CCN.com</title><link>https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQdERUR3lFb2s4RTE5bmN6d3FBZERPaU