ator>Logan Hitchcock</dc:creator>\\n  \\n  \\n    <guid isPermaLink=\\\"false\\\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368562</guid>\\n  \\n  \\n    <enclosure url=\\\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Bitcoin-decrypt-style-09-gID_7.png@png\\\" length=\\\"1000000\\\" type=\\\"image/png\\\" />\\n  \\n  \\n    \\n      <category></category>\\n    \\n      <category>Markets</category>\\n    \\n  \\n  \\n  \\n  \\n  \\n  \\n    \\n      <media:thumbnail url=\\\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Bitcoin-decrypt-style-09-gID_7.png\\\" height=\\\"2000\\\" width=\\\"3556\\\"/>\\n    \\n    \\n  \\n  \\n  \\n  \\n  \\n  \\n  \\n  \\n\\n\\n\\n</item>\\n    \\n      <item>\\n  <title>Shai-Hulud: What to Know About the Malware Spreading Through Software Pipelines</title>\\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368477/shai-hulud-what-know-malware-spreading-software-pipelines</link>\\n  <pubDate>Wed, 20 May 2026 23:00:04 +0000</pubDate>\\n  \\n    <description>The Shai-Hulud supply-chain malware campaign is exploiting the automated systems developers trust to publish software safely.</description>\\n  \\n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\\n  \\n  \\n    <guid isPermaLink=\\\"false\\\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368477</guid>\\n  \\n  \\n    <enclosure url=\\\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/crime_hacker-gID_7.png@png\\\" length=\\\"1000000\\\" type=\\\"image/png\\\" />\\n  \\n  \\n    \\n      <category>Technology</category>\\n    \\n  \\n  \\n  \\n  \\n  \\n  \\n    \\n      <media:thumbnail url=\\\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/crime_hacker-gID_7.png\\\" height=\\\"1000\\\" width=\\\"1778\\\"/>\\n    \\n    \\n  \\n  \\n  \\n  \\n  \\n  \\n  \\n  \\n\\n\\n\\n</item>\\n    \\n      <item>\\n  <title>SpaceX IPO Filing Shows Musk Building an AI and Space Infrastructure Giant</title>\\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368573/sp