 Kulechov, Aave Labs head of contracts Emilio Frangella, Kelp DAO, Golem Foundation, Web3 development platform BGD Labs and Babylon, a Bitcoin-native DeFi protocol. Another $215 million has been pledged by Arbitrum, Mantle, Ether.fi and Lido to assist the recovery effort, which are subject to governance votes. LayerZero, Ethena, Ink Foundation and Frax Finance have also signaled their intention to help. Aave was hit hard by the Kelp DAO exploit, with its total value locked falling nearly $12 billion in a week after the hacker put the stolen rsETH tokens up as collateral on its lending platform to borrow wrapped Ether, leaving more than $190 million in bad debt and triggering a wave of withdrawals. In the Arbitrum proposal, Aave Labs said a full recovery would not only restore rsETH’s backing but also normalize conditions for its holders, liquidity providers and borrowers on Arbitrum and across the broader DeFi ecosystem. Even a “partial recovery would still meaningfully reduce the shortfall,” Aave Labs added. Aave Labs has specifically asked for the 30,765 Ether to be sent to a recovery address controlled by Aave, Kelp DAO and blockchain security platform Certora. Aave Labs said it expects the effort to restore rsETH and compensate its holders to take about 49 days and that it would return the funds if the recovery effort falls through.\", \"combined_key_facts\": [\"Aave Labs has proposed that the Arbitrum DAO unfreeze $73.5 million in Ether (30,765 ETH) tied to the Kelp DAO attack.\", \"The proposal requests the funds be sent to “DeFi United,” a multi-protocol effort to restore the rsETH token and compensate its holders.\", \"Aave's founder, Stani Kulechov, has personally pledged 5,000 ETH of his own money to the recovery fund.\", \"The 'DeFi United' fund has already seen $21 million in contributions, with an additional $215 million pledged by entities like Arbitrum, Mantle, and Lido, pending governance votes.\", \"The Kelp DAO exploit left the Aave protocol with over $190 million in bad debt, causing its TVL to drop by nearly $12 billion.\", \"Aave Labs outlined a seven-week (49-day) timeline for the recovery and compensation plan.\"], \"primary_headline\": \"Aave Leads ‘DeFi United’ Push to Contain $292M KelpDAO Fallout\", \"primary_keyword\": \"DeFi United KelpDAO\", \"source_urls\": [\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/arbitrum-dao-asked-to-unfreeze-30k-eth-tied-to-kelp-hacker-direct-them-to-defi-united\", \"https://decrypt.co/365431/aave-leads-defi-united-push-to-contain-292m-kelpdao-fallout\"], \"sources_used\": [\"Cointelegraph\", \"Decrypt\"], \"topic_theme\": \"DeFi United recovery effort for KelpDAO exploit\"}\n/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator/SOUL.md:49:python3 ~/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator/skills/pipeline/validate_research.py \\\n/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator/SOUL.md:53:   - Prints `RESEARCH_VALID: <headline>` on success → proceed.\n/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator/SOUL.md:147:- Links: exactly 2 distinct source anchors in hook/first H2 only (URLs from source_urls in validated.json).","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779440501063}}
